OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will get off to a rather
OL,6,Fcloudy start with showery outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain. The showers will become more
OL,8,Fscattered during the day, allowing
OL,9,Fsome bright to sunny spells to develop
OL,10,Fat times. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, though breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere will be a mix of clear
OL,14,Fspells and scattered showers during
OL,15,Fthe evening, though most of the
OL,16,Fshowers will die out overnight. A
OL,17,Fmild, though still breezy night
OL,18,Funfolding.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
